               <string>&lt;b&gt;Sleep stages&lt;/b&gt; (SleepStage table, one event per epoch)&lt;br/&gt;• group: stage&lt;br/&gt;• name: the value of the table: 0 (wake), 1 (N1), 2 (N2), 3 (N3), 4 (N4), 5 (REM), 6 (movement), 7 (technician intervention) or 9 (unscored)&lt;br/&gt;• start_sec: start of the epoch (s)&lt;br/&gt;• duration_sec: EpochLength (from the XML file)</string>
